USED) y el activity graph 402 (Payment required).\nSon instancias gratuitas de Vercel que se quedan sin cuota.\n\nAgrega scripts/build_stats.py: consulta la GraphQL API de GitHub y emite\nstats/langs/activity en dark y light dentro de assets/. Incluye calculo\npropio de rachas, por lo que tambien sale la tarjeta de streak-stats.\n\nEl heatmap agrega por semana y usa una fila por ano: a escala de dia un\nperfil cuyo trabajo vive en repos privados se ve vacio aunque no lo este.\n\nbuild-stats.yml lo refresca a diario y valida que el SVG sea XML bien\nformado antes de commitear.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20dec22f658a7b7f0f33dffd95d9a53ab4b97201","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eddieelorza/eddieelorza/git/trees/20dec22f658a7b7f0f33dffd95d9a53ab4b97201"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eddieelorza/eddieelorza/git/commits/1bb1afaf10087f868084b3b687656348297d67b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81988834?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddieelorza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddieelorza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddieelorza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddieelorza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eddieelorza","id":81988834,"login":"eddieelorza","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTg4ODM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddieelorza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddieelorza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddieelorza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddieelorza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddieelorza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddieelorza","user_view_typ