:"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"state-mirror: switch base image from python:3.12-slim to ubuntu:24.04 (#379)\n\nAlign the ufm-state-mirror image with UFM''s standard Ubuntu base. Ubuntu\n24.04 (Noble) ships the Python 3.12 the engine targets, so no deadsnakes\nPPA is needed. Dependencies install into a venv at /opt/venv (placed on\nPATH) so pip works under PEP 668 (externally-managed) and the existing\n`python -m state_mirror.{mirror,restore}` entrypoints keep working.\n\nA trivy scan also favors Ubuntu here: python:3.12-slim now tracks Debian\n13 (trixie), which currently carries 2 CRITICAL + 9 HIGH OS CVEs (perl --\nunused by the sidecar -- plus sqlite/ncurses), whereas the ubuntu:24.04\nbuild scans with 0 HIGH/CRITICAL. Cost is ~22 MB more (183 -> 205 MB).","tree":{"sha":"936b34ce947b8bf6aa4d45b9dfdc3746de4233d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mellanox/ufm_sdk_3.0/git/trees/936b34ce947b8bf6aa4d45b9dfdc3746de4233d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mellanox/ufm_sdk_3.0/git/commits/3e96418e99b12096d7c5709e0a3a7e7049d2a55f","verification":{"payload":"tree 936b34ce947b8bf6aa4d45b9dfdc3746de4233d4\nparent 64a98858568c9e56dc507b8a24cccc8c81cfbc4d\nauthor shmufeld <97442151+shmufeld@users.noreply.github.com> 1782655390 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782655390 +0300\n\nstate-mirror: switch base image from python:3.12-slim to ubuntu:24.04 (#379)\n\nAlign the ufm-state-mirror image with UFM''s standard Ubuntu base. Ubuntu\n24.04 (Noble) ships the Python 3.12 the engine targets, so no deadsnakes\nPPA is needed. Dependencies install into a venv at /opt/venv (placed on\nPATH) so pip works under PEP 668 (externally-managed) and the existing\n`python -m state_mirror.{mirror,restore}` entrypoints keep working.\n\nA trivy scan also favors Ubuntu here: python:3.12-slim now tracks Debian\n13 (trixie), which currently carries 2 CRITICAL + 9 HIGH OS CVEs (perl --\nunused by the sidecar -- plus sqlite/ncurses), whereas the ubuntu:24.04\nbuild 