:{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160493207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boazhaim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boazhaim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boazhaim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boazhaim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boazhaim","id":160493207,"login":"boazhaim","node_id":"U_kgDOCZDulw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boazhaim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boazhaim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boazhaim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boazhaim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boazhaim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boazhaim","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mellanox/ufm_sdk_3.0/commits/0baa680876245b8a42e1f627dd88884aa4bc43c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-30T09:33:35Z","email":"160493207+boazhaim@users.noreply.github.com","name":"boazhaim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-30T09:33:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: merge watchdog nodeAffinity with user-provided nodeAffinity instead of replacing it (#367)\n\nThe watchdog affinity logic used `set $affinity \"nodeAffinity\" (dict ...)`\nwhich silently replaced any user-provided nodeAffinity (e.g. GPU node\nselectors, zone constraints). This caused pods to lose scheduling\nconstraints with no warning, leading to runtime failures.\n\nNow the template reads existing nodeSelectorTerms and appends the\nwatchdog matchExpression to each one (AND semantics), preserving the\nuser''s constraints. When no user nodeAffinity exists, a fresh term is\ncreated as before. preferredDuringScheduling rules are also preserved.\n\nAdded CI regression test with gpu-type nodeAffinity fixture and\nassertions verifying both user and watchdog expressions are present.","tree":{"sha":"f953b80faf04cea341cd789f0073537cbd7f2bf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mellanox/ufm_sdk_3.0/git/trees/f953b80faf04cea341cd789f0073537cbd7f2bf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mellanox/ufm_sdk_3.0/git/commits/0baa680876245b8a42e1f627dd88884aa4bc43c4","verification":{"payload":"tree f953b80faf04cea341cd789f0073537cbd7f2bf6\nparent 846e02782d0c2e017ccfe525b98c01a7bfefcbd6\nauthor boazhaim <160493207+boazhaim@users.noreply.github.com> 1774863215 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774863215 +0300\n\nfix: merge watchdog nodeAffinity with user-provided nodeAffinity instead of replacing it (#367)\n\nThe watchdog affinity logic used `set $affinity \"nodeAffinity\" (dict ...)`\nwhich silently replaced any user-provided nodeAffinity (e.g. GPU node\nselectors, zone constraints). This caused pods to lose scheduling\nconstraints with no warning, leading to runtime failures.\n\nNow the template reads existing nodeSelectorTerms and appends the\nwatchdog matchExpression to each one (AND semantics), preserving the\nuser''s constraints. When no user nodeAffinity exists, a fresh term is\ncreated as before. preferredDuringScheduling rules are also preserved.\n\nAdded CI regression test with gpu-type nodeAffinity fixture and\nassertions verifying both user and watchdog expressions are present.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpykNvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjuoQAEK9ge8hiyN/UqBys7+nXFDA\nAzFA99xVCLEflE6MDlK3WryWfD8fBPdaPh11qGRlnIjVRW78zXSzEBcyW+AKK95Y\nEgBdEUmyzqrPJB+NIC1jqnvxuHG9i/SJszcq0XRAUG+yMVNOLuc6NyB0d1F3dYbJ\nLlxAlkPq3Damc9TmRDPeaZJyxUVkzdW25nXpU+ChY9bFggraZ0o4RSeBFIVcZF2A\nrZgf89bZUAbi3HOcnDlbYQWn5Lf/NaDQjG6p8a8NexONiO5CMoJyzOseCy8WkN45\n/zh8uNWiTc++HhHNPS2UR/+kDN3k+CSyAZus+K1CwWtzUWu3LDIyxQ/NKUYRqkla\nGecUN5SQZ8w1KbAcG03HeIRIODzsqrXfy7KGnftsEkdUBb4h80mN5Pfo9Zllo5qB\nu7TKMz7Guly6ZWaBqb164lvFlS2t/LG3BApWeQog+Doib9bbfCTnI